      "text" : "And enjoy your Valentine's Day."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Hello, I only make the Valentine rings to those experienced adventurer Level 75 or above."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "You're not fully experienced yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Come back when you're experienced enough to handle the quests."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "The box with the ring, carved with your name, is for the one you love."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "As for the rings that you receive from others, they should all be registered with the Vote Manager."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "She is standing near the Prontera Fountain."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Only the most popular male and female are subjected to getting rewards."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Be aware, and always try to stay popular!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Hi, there, how are ya?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Come to me if you're interested in the event, 'Who's Valentine's Hottest?'"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "I make the most precious rings that you can give to your sweethearts."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Those rings are very special because I carve your names on them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Isn't it exciting?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Isn't it such a brilliant idea?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Give these special rings to your sweethearts!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "You should hurry 'cuz this event will only last for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Give that special someone a gift of a Valentine's ring."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Remember, you can only generate the ring once."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "You also need Wrapping Paper, Wrapping Strap and a Box to make the ring."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "So you better be sure of who you give this to."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "By the way, It costs 1,000 zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Would you like to make one?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Hmm.. I gotta give it a second thought..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Sure."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Alrighty!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "You can't put a rush on such a thing like this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Think about what you truly want."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Just follow your heart!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Well, you don't have enough materials to make a gift box."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Check what you have, and come back later with all the materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Okie Dokie!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "I'll make it right away."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Here, the most precious ring in the world!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Don't forget, you can never make this ring again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "You must pick out the one that you really really love, and give this ring to that person."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "[Event Ring Maker]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Of course, you've got to get rings from others, that's the way you can participate in the voting, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Event Ring Maker",
      "text" : "Challenge yourself to become Valentine's Hottest!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Hello, I'm the Valentine's Vote Manager."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I'm in charge of collecting rings for this event!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 408,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 409,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I register the rings you get from others and I calculate the total number of rings."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 411,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 412,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "You know what I do besides just counting those rings?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 413,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I can tell you the adventurer's name who's got the most number of votes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 415,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 416,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Plus, you can also find out how many votes he/she got."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 420,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "So, what do you want?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Please register my rings."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Please count my votes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Nothing, for now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 424,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Please tell me how many rings you want to register."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 427,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 428,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "When you write the number of the rings, the number shouldn't be larger than the number of rings you actually have."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "'0', cancels everything."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 434,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 435,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "You have entered 0."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Registration is cancelled."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 443,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 444,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Seems like the value you entered is too small."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 445,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I know you've got more. Be honest, dear."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 451,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 452,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Seems like the value you entered is too large."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 453,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I know you've got less. Be honest, dear."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 458,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 459,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "I'll take those silver rings, and count the votes for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 460,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Thank you for participating."
    },
