      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 505,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "$Val09name_M$",
        "$Val09votes_M"
      ],
      "text" : "The current record shows... {0} is the male vote leader who's registered the total of {1} rings."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 507,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "$Val09name_F$",
        "$Val09votes_F"
      ],
      "text" : "The current record shows... {0} is the female vote leader who's registered the total of {1} rings."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 513,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "[Valentine Vote Manager]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 514,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Hey, you can be popular too!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Anyone can... really!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 516,
      "npc" : "Valentine Vote Manager",
      "text" : "Though you have to try a lot harder, but still~ Hahaha!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 526,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 527,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Monsieur~! What brings you to my beautiful atelier?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 528,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "What is it that you want?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 529,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Well, my sparkling eyes get dried and lose their shine if not for the pretty little lady."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 531,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 532,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Please leave me alone unless you have business with me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 533,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Haaaa~ I'm a busy person."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 534,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Don't bother me...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 535,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Annoying, annoying, annoying~~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 539,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 540,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Oh, Mademoiselle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 541,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "This little trifling space felt like heaven the minute you walked in!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 542,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Can I help you with anything, if it's alright?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 544,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Please, make me some chocolate."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 544,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Don't bother. I'm just passing by."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 545,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 546,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Ahhh, this is so heartbreaking."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 547,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "How could you say that?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 548,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "You're just so mean."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 549,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Don't bother? Just passing by?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 551,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 552,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "What can I do to make you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 553,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "pay a little attention to me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 554,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Please.. I feel like my soul is lost.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 558,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 559,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Ahhh, Mademoiselle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 560,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I'm not an alchemist, or a magician."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 561,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I don't just make chocolate out of anything."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 563,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 564,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I always think of making chocolate as artistic work."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 565,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "You see, I'm no ordinary cook..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 566,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I make chocolate with feelings.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 567,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "messages of loving hearts.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 569,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 570,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I make masterpieces."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 571,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "No one can imitate the looks and the taste."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 572,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Yes, it's nothing like ordinary chocolate!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 574,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 575,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I'm afraid I can't make it and prove it to you now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 576,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "This is really a shame!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 578,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 579,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I really want to thank you for visiting me and if you only bring ^3152ff3 Chocolates^000000, I'll make you chocolate like you've never seen..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 581,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 582,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "never tasted before..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 583,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Mademoiselle, with your spirit, I'm sure you can bring 3 pieces of chocolate."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 584,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I have no doubt at all."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 586,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 587,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "So... what do you think?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 588,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Can you bring ^3152ff3 Chocolates^000000?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 589,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I could get them myself, but I'm tied up with so much work as you see right now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 591,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 592,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Adios, Mademoiselle....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 593,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I'll be waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 597,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 598,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "You're carrying too many items."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 599,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Please use the Kafra Services."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 602,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 603,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Oh, Mademoiselle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 604,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I'll make the best chocolate with the pieces you've brought."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 605,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I'm going to put the light of your eyes into this chocolate that no one can resist."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 607,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 608,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "It'll be stronger than a sweet sweet love potion....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 610,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 611,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Un, Deux, Trois, Quatre....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 612,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Just like the ugly duckling that turned to a beautiful swan-"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 613,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Ordinary chocolate pieces are becoming a piece of art!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 615,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 616,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "They're changing!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 617,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "They're getting warm, softly changing the shape, getting stronger again!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 618,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Oh, is it a master piece or"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 619,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "what...!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 621,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 622,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Here you go, Mademoiselle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 623,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Ahahahaha, just look at this!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 624,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "I can't believe I made this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 625,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Oh, I can't take my eyes off..!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 629,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "[Charles Orleans]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 630,
      "npc" : "Dessert Manager",
      "text" : "Alright. Mademoiselle,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
